WeatherGPT — Team Techtonics (SIH 2026, PS SIH26068)

This repository includes data from third parties:

GeoNames
  data/gazetteer/in_places.json.gz contains place names, alternate names,
  coordinates, populations and administrative divisions derived from the
  GeoNames geographical database (https://www.geonames.org/):
  cities500.txt, alternatenames/IN.txt, admin1CodesASCII.txt and
  admin2Codes.txt (https://download.geonames.org/export/dump/), downloaded
  2026-10-03 and filtered to India and the en/ta/hi/te/mr languages by
  scripts/import_geonames.py.

